ier><DisplayName>Message</DisplayName><Description>Human-readable summary of what the digital twin did</Description><DataType><Basic>String</Basic></DataType></Response><DefinedExecutionErrors><Identifier>SpeedOutOfRange</Identifier></DefinedExecutionErrors></Command><Command><Identifier>StopShaking</Identifier><DisplayName>Stop Shaking</DisplayName><Description>Stop shaking.</Description><Observable>No</Observable><Response><Identifier>Message</Identifier><DisplayName>Message</DisplayName><Description>Human-readable summary of what the digital twin did</Description><DataType><Basic>String</Basic></DataType></Response></Command><Property><Identifier>CurrentTemperature</Identifier><DisplayName>Current Temperature</DisplayName><Description>Current block temperature, C</Description><Observable>Yes</Observable><DataType><Basic>Real</Basic></DataType></Property><Property><Identifier>ShakingSpeed</Identifier><DisplayName>Shaking Speed</DisplayName><Description>Current shaking speed in rpm (0 = stopped)</Description><Observable>No</Observable><DataType><Basic>Integer</Basic></DataType></Property><DefinedExecutionError><Identifier>TemperatureOutOfRange</Identifier><DisplayName>Temperature Out Of Range</DisplayName><Description>Target must be between 4 and 70 C.</Description></DefinedExecutionError><DefinedExecutionError><Identifier>SpeedOutOfRange</Identifier><DisplayName>Speed Out Of Range</DisplayName><Description>Speed must be between 200 and 3000 rpm.</Description></DefinedExecutionError></Feature>
